### Test 1: Unassign Units - Pair
POST {{baseUrl}}/Geofence/unassignUnits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignments": [
    {
      "unitId": 5001,
      "geofenceId": 7781
    }
  ]
}

### Test 2: Unassign Units - All units of a geofence
POST {{baseUrl}}/Geofence/unassignUnits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "geofenceId": 7781
}

### Test 3: Unassign Units - Invalid (two options)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Geofence/unassignUnits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "geofenceId": 7781,
  "unitId": 5001
}
